cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Symbio-Grid: an evolutionary agent-based model of plant–fungi resource symbiosis"
abstract: >-
  An open-source agent-based model of an evolving resource economy between plants and
  fungi, built on Mesa. Ships as a real-time Pygame visualization and a headless,
  reproducible science batch runner.
type: software
authors:
